Notes:
1. For input/output tensors, only data types float and int8_t are supported;
2. For position tensors, only data types int32_t and are supported;
3. The reference implementation in lite/kernels/internal/reference/gather.h is not used;
4. The TFLM Gather kernel supports batch_dims.
